elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">支付宝联合高德动量发布“AI 付·具身智能”，实现机器狗自主支付</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">支付宝AI支付产品体系再进化，新推AI钱包智能体及三大“AI收”能力</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 将 GPT-Live-1 模型引入 API，支持全双工实时语音交互与打断</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团发布智能体信任基础设施APASS，支持Agent可信商业活动</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e2e11688a1e107ab2435d919d6f8efa9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">9月11日，蚂蚁集团在2026 Inclusion·外滩大会发布面向智能体（Agent）的信任基础设施APASS。该系统基于KYA（Know Your Agent）理念，通过智能体可信身份产品与风控服务，建立身份与行为双重信任链，提供身份注册、持续核验、意图安全及可信存证能力，解决Agent在调用服务、办理业务及支付等商业活动中的信任难题。APASS通过静态、运行时及责任主体三层身份模型，结合六维核验机制，实现对Agent全生命周期的风险管理。目前，APASS已接入超100万个Agent，覆盖442家服务供给方。同时，蚂蚁联合阿里巴巴、理想汽车、智谱等50余家机构发起IIFAA智能体可信生态共建计划，并对接Alipay+ AMP、Mastercard及Visa等国际协议，推动跨境场景下的Agent身份互联互通。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">极摩客发布EVO-X5 Pro迷你主机，支持192GB内存运行300B大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/df72b55f1ccdf0bf96f63da483789d82.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">极摩客在IFA 2026展会上正式发布旗舰迷你主机EVO-X5 Pro，该机搭载AMD锐龙AI Max+ PRO 495处理器，集成Zen5架构CPU、RDNA 3.5架构核显及XDNA 2架构NPU，整机算力达131 TOPS。核心亮点在于配备192GB LPDDR5X-8533统一内存，带宽达273GB/s，支持最高160GB显存动态分配，现场演示运行Qwen3.8-Flash-Next模型表现流畅，具备本地运行300B参数级LLM的能力。散热方面采用VC均热板与三风扇系统，并设有F-MODE实体按键支持三档TDP切换。接口配置包括2个USB4及2个USB4 V2接口，支持外接显卡坞与分布式集群组建，并配备双万兆网口。该机型仅提供192GB顶配版，预计2026年10月上市，售价暂未公布。此产品通过大内存与统</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">支付宝联合高德动量发布“AI 付·具身智能”，实现机器狗自主支付</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2e127843f1cf62e7616b49fa0090fd42.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">9月11日，支付宝宣布与高德动量达成合作，正式推出“AI 付·具身智能”解决方案，首次将AI支付能力集成至具身智能设备。高德动量机器狗“途途”作为首批应用载体，可在用户授权范围内执行跑腿任务并完成自主支付，实现“打酱油”场景的自动化闭环。该技术核心依托蚂蚁集团自主研发的APASS商业信任基础设施，基于KYA（Know Your Agent）理念构建，通过对智能体的身份核验、意图识别、授权管理及行为审计，建立全链路信任机制。此次发布标志着AI支付从基础的“能付”功能向“可信地付”的深度演进，为具身智能在商业服务场景的落地提供了安全可信的支付交互范式，推动了Agent在物理世界的商业化应用进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">支付宝AI支付产品体系再进化，新推AI钱包智能体及三大“AI收”能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6fad849eb6e6e36aaa909f346a454f5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">支付宝AI支付产品体系再进化，新推AI钱包智能体及三大“AI收”能力AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 11, 202615在外滩大会上，支付宝宣布AI支付进一步从“可支付”迈向“可信支付”:一方面支付宝将推出AI钱包智能体，帮助用户管理每一笔 AI付交易。另一方面，持续升级AI支付产品体系，推出Vibe Pay、Skill Pay、Machine Pay三大“AI收”能力，以及AI周期购、AI帮你抢、AI帮你订等新场景。更值得关注的是，支付宝AI付应用蚂蚁集团自主打造的APASS商业信任基础设施。基于KYA（Know Your Agent）理念，APASS围绕智能体的身份、意图、授权和行为建立全过程信任机制，让AI支付从“能付”进一步走向“可信地付”。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 将 GPT-Live-1 模型引入 API，支持全双工实时语音交互与打断</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2088fbb1778cd8facf392bc40fd7d386.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 正式将 GPT-Live-1 模型引入 API，旨在赋能开发者构建具备实时语音交互能力的智能体。该模型采用语音理解与输出一体化架构，通过消除“语音转文字-LLM-文字转语音”的链路，显著降低了交互延迟。GPT-Live-1 支持全双工对话，能处理打断、停顿及背景噪声，并具备字母数字理解、关键词偏置及轮次检测能力。在应用场景上，该模型可接入电话系统用于客服或预订服务，并支持与Codex等工具联动，执行企业系统查询及获批操作。评测显示，其在Full Duplex Bench测试中较GPT-Realtime-2.1提升30个百分点。价格方面，前端语音层定价为每分钟0.05美元，后端模型费用另计。OpenAI此次还新增了12种语音选项，包括Quartz、Ripple等，以满足多样化开发需求。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
